# Judge4-10-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:除非我用<br>遥控器操控，<br>或者有人在地下设施<br>进行操作，<br>否则处刑台是不会移动的。|#0104Trial10_Warden001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:但实际上却留下了<br>处刑台移动过的记录。|#0104Trial10_Warden002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"从昨晚到今天早上的<br>这段时间里……<br>到底为什么处刑台会<br><link=\"Objection_01_04_10_01\">移动了</link>呢？|#0104Trial10_Warden003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆投げやり

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:是不是你记错了？<br>也有可能是<br>你骗我们。|#0104Trial10_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:说到底我只是<br>这座监牢的管理员，<br>没必要和大家说谎。<br>……虽然有很多事<br>我不能告诉大家。|#0104Trial10_Warden004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

